    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i don't think a defense mechanism explains it. it feels more like a fact. some people bring light into the world and some people just take up space and cause harm by just existing. i look at my life and i don't see anything worth saving. it just feels like i'm a mistake that hasn't been corrected yet.",
